# models/

This directory stores model weight files at runtime.
Weights are never committed to git (see .gitignore).
Place your model files here following the paths configured in `.env`.

Example layout:
```
models/
  weights/
    detector.pt        ← detector model weights (ADR-001)
    tracker/           ← tracker model files (ADR-002)
    ocr/               ← OCR model files (ADR-003)
    asr/               ← ASR model files (ADR-004)
```
